## Admission Output

An admitted task produces a scoped `ExecutionGrant`.

The grant must bind at minimum:

- principal;
- tenant;
- project;
- job/task;
- allowed capability;
- allowed tools;
- allowed resources;
- expiration;
- risk/policy state;
- budget envelope.

